{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Legend has over 200 card characters. Choose a faction and pair it with your own Heavenly God team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/c646becef1e9e5cecfe6c57804614842.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Dazzling game graphics, exciting audio-visual enjoyment]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game showcases two hundred heavenly gods with comic level art quality. The game features exquisite 2D illustrations, Spnie animations, and 3D character battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/575d9c391a80ba5dea409ea4a1d78144.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple lineup combinations, flexible combinations dominate the heavens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, it is necessary to match a reasonable card lineup to achieve the best output effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/c1a2b27b57f9ea32968e1bc750c55140.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First release welfare gift, with a hundred cards to connect with you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes battles between gods from the East, Greece, India, and other regions, with the first installment featuring enhanced welfare and internal competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/0c0e47ebeeb8fb4060681c2ad44273db.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot summary:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the new era of the divine calendar, all things undergo changes and chaos in time and space. The Gate of the Realm has emerged, connecting the various divine realms\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The god Zeus seized this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity and was the first to seize the power of the Door. Leading hundreds of major gods in Olympus, with the intention of unifying the heavenly realm and becoming the true king of all gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eastern gods have become the last force to resist the God King\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/5411aae10d35bb9cffd3df3ff77b6739.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3882370?t=1760368904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/0233f794fe7f947517e75c8f8718f6f75404fed0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760368904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/6501c5cc59569b0d5cf0027252b81ae515a2df73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760368904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/6501c5cc59569b0d5cf0027252b81ae515a2df73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760368904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal Legend has over 200 card characters. Choose a faction and pair it with your own Heavenly God team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/c646becef1e9e5cecfe6c57804614842.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Dazzling game graphics, exciting audio-visual enjoyment]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game showcases two hundred heavenly gods with comic level art quality. The game features exquisite 2D illustrations, Spnie animations, and 3D character battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/575d9c391a80ba5dea409ea4a1d78144.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple lineup combinations, flexible combinations dominate the heavens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, it is necessary to match a reasonable card lineup to achieve the best output effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/c1a2b27b57f9ea32968e1bc750c55140.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First release welfare gift, with a hundred cards to connect with you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes battles between gods from the East, Greece, India, and other regions, with the first installment featuring enhanced welfare and internal competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/0c0e47ebeeb8fb4060681c2ad44273db.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot summary:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the new era of the divine calendar, all things undergo changes and chaos in time and space. The Gate of the Realm has emerged, connecting the various divine realms\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The god Zeus seized this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity and was the first to seize the power of the Door. Leading hundreds of major gods in Olympus, with the intention of unifying the heavenly realm and becoming the true king of all gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eastern gods have become the last force to resist the God King\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/extras/5411aae10d35bb9cffd3df3ff77b6739.avif?t=1760368904\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p>","developers":["Crystal Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882370/93268d7a761ce79df8f29d3af03daa7aab65eecc/header.jpg?t=1760368904","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882370/1029077675/7be793a3b2f233c14fa2bbeb69a7d890eb1cb3e0/1756615916/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756616999","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882370/1029077675/7be793a3b2f233c14fa2bbeb69a7d890eb1cb3e0/1756615916/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756616999","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3882370/1029077675/7be793a3b2f233c14fa2bbeb69a7d890eb1cb3e0/1756615916/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756616999","id":257191288,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor